HST Office: groups come back from the chevron popup in their place.

The ladder folds groups in the tab's fold order, which may start at the left (Writer folds Clipboard
first). Closing the chevron popup hands the groups back with Window::SetParent, which appends them to
the children: Clipboard came back after Styles, the ribbon showed Font, Paragraph, Styles, Clipboard
when widened, and the tab's ladder no longer matched the groups' order. The merged box remembers the
authored order at its first layout and puts the children back in it before each layout.

- vcl/inc/PriorityMergedHBox.hxx, vcl/source/control/PriorityMergedHBox.cxx.

